{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg9Nye5ZmiW9yRBPfS6RE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Flagship model API pricing: Anthropic vs. OpenAI vs. Google\n\n**I couldn't check the live pricing pages.** I have no web or fetch tools in this session, so I can't confirm today's (2026-10-18) prices. The figures below are the last ones I'm confident about, from late 2025. Newer models have probably launched since then, including the Claude 5 family, and prices may have changed. Please check the official pages linked below before relying on any of these numbers.\n\n## Last-known list prices (USD per 1M tokens, standard tier)\n\n| Provider | Model (as of late 2025) | Input | Output | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Anthropic | Claude Opus 4.5 | $5.00 | $25.00 | Earlier Opus 4/4.1 cost $15 / $75 |\n| Anthropic | Claude Sonnet 4.5 | $3.00 | $15.00 | Higher rate for prompts over 200K tokens |\n| OpenAI | GPT-5 / GPT-5.1 | $1.25 | $10.00 | Cached input is cheaper |\n| OpenAI | GPT-5 pro | $15.00 | $120.00 | Premium reasoning tier |\n| Google | Gemini 3 Pro (preview) | $2.00 / $4.00 | $12.00 / $18.00 | Lower rate up to 200K-token prompts, higher rate above |\n| Google | Gemini 2.5 Pro | $1.25 / $2.50 | $10.00 / $15.00 | Lower rate up to 200K-token prompts, higher rate above |\n\n## How they compared at that time\n- **Cheapest flagship:** OpenAI GPT-5 at $1.25 / $10. Google's Gemini models were close, with Gemini 3 Pro at $2 / $12 for shorter prompts.\n- **Most expensive standard flagship:** Anthropic Opus 4.5 at $5 / $25. That was still a large cut from the earlier Opus price of $15 / $75.\n- **Premium tiers:** OpenAI's GPT-5 pro, at $15 / $120, cost more than any of the standard flagships.\n- **Discounts:** All three providers offered lower rates for batch requests and for cached prompts.\n\n## Official pricing pages to check\n- Anthropic: https://www.anthropic.com/pricing#api (also https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/about-claude/pricing)\n- OpenAI: https://openai.com/api/pricing/ (also https://platform.openai.com/docs/pricing)\n- Google Gemini API: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\n\nIf you can enable web access, or paste in the current contents of those pages, I can turn them into a verified, up-to-date comparison table with proper citations."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2462,"cache_read_input_tokens":535,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2462},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c37be888-282e-46ff-a404-d32542fb4097","uuid":"e1650864-df56-423f-bd28-d083494b8ac2","timestamp":"2026-10-18T08:23:03.780Z","request_id":"req_011Cg9NydrRgoAKqJTqSxrJD"}
